{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-14-1","title":"1 Corinthians 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Prophecy is commended, 2 and preferred before speaking with tongues, 6 by a comparison drawn from musical instruments. 12 Both must be referred to edification, 22 as to their true and proper end. 26 The true use of each is taught, 27 and the abuse taxed. 34 Women are forbidden to speak in church.</p>\n<p>Follow. Pr 15:9; 21:21; Isa 51:1; Ro 9:30; 14:19; 1Ti 5:10; 6:11; Heb 12:14 1Pe 3:11-13; 3Jo 1:11 charity. 13:1-8,13; 2Ti 2:22; 2Pe 1:7 desire. 12:1,31; Eph 1:3 prophesy. 3-5,24,25,37,39; 13:2,9; Nu 11:25-29; Ro 12:6; 1Th 5:20; 1Ti 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-2","title":"1 Corinthians 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>he that. 9-11,16,21,22; Ge 11:7; 42:23; De 28:49; 2Ki 18:26; Ac 2:4-11; 10:46 Ac 19:6 understandeth. Gr. heareth. Ac 22:9 howbeit. 2:7,10; 13:2; 15:51; Ps 49:3,4; 78:2; Mt 13:11; Mr 4:11; Ro 16:25 Eph 3:3-9; 6:19; Col 1:26,27; 2:2; 1Ti 3:9,16; Re 10:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-3","title":"1 Corinthians 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>edification. 4,12,26; 8:1; 10:23; Ac 9:31; Ro 14:19; 15:2; Eph 4:12-16,29 1Th 5:11; 1Ti 1:4; Jude 1:20 exhortation. Lu 3:18; Ac 13:15; 14:22; 15:32; Ro 12:8; 1Th 2:3; 4:1; 5:11,14 2Th 3:12; 1Ti 4:13; 6:2; 2Ti 4:2; Tit 1:9; 2:6,9,15; Heb 3:13; 10:25 Heb 13:22; 1Pe 5:12 comfort. 31; 2Co 1:4; 2:7; Eph 6:22; Col 4:8; 1Th 2:11; 3:2; 4:18; 5:11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-4","title":"1 Corinthians 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>edifieth himself. 14 edifieth the. 3,18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-5","title":"1 Corinthians 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>would. 12:28-30; 13:4; Nu 11:28,29 for. 1,3 except. 12,13,26-28; 12:10,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-6","title":"1 Corinthians 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>what shall I. 10:33; 12:7; 13:3; 1Sa 12:21; Jer 16:19; 23:32; Mt 16:26; 2Ti 2:14 Tit 3:8; Heb 13:9 revelation. 26-30; Mt 11:25; 16:17; 2Co 12:1,7; Eph 1:17; Php 3:15 knowledge. 12:8; 13:2,8,9; Ro 15:14; 2Co 11:6; Eph 3:4; 2Pe 1:5; 3:18 prophesying. 1; 13:2 doctrine. 26; Ro 16:17; 2Ti 3:10,16; 4:2; 2Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-7","title":"1 Corinthians 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>things. 13:1 except. 8; Nu 10:2-10; Mt 11:17; Lu 7:32 sounds. or, tunes.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-8","title":"1 Corinthians 14:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Nu 10:9; Jos 6:4-20; Jud 7:16-18; Ne 4:18-21; Job 39:24,25 Isa 27:13; Am 3:6; Eph 6:11-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-9","title":"1 Corinthians 14:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>easy. Gr. significant. 19 for. 9:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-11","title":"1 Corinthians 14:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I shall. 21; Ac 28:2,4; Ro 1:14; Col 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-12","title":"1 Corinthians 14:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>forasmuch. 1; 12:7,31; Tit 2:14 spiritual gifts. Gr. spirits. 32 seek. 3,4,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-13","title":"1 Corinthians 14:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>pray. 27,28; 12:10,30; Mr 11:24; Joh 14:13,14; Ac 1:14; 4:29-31; 8:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-14","title":"1 Corinthians 14:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>my spirit. 2,15,16,19 but.That is, \"not productive of any benefit to others.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-15","title":"1 Corinthians 14:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>What. 10:19; Ro 3:5; 8:31; Php 1:18 I will pray with the spirit. 19; Joh 4:23,24; Ro 1:9; Eph 5:17-20; 6:18; Col 3:16; Jude 1:20 and I will sing. Ps 47:7; Ro 12:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-16","title":"1 Corinthians 14:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>bless. 2,14 unlearned. 23,24; Isa 29:11,12; Joh 7:15; Ac 4:13 Amen. 11:24; 16:24; Nu 5:22; De 27:15-26; 1Ki 1:36; 1Ch 16:36; Ps 41:13 Ps 72:19; 89:52; 106:48; Jer 28:6; Mt 6:13; 28:20; Mr 16:20 Joh 21:25; Re 5:14; 22:20 at. 1:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-17","title":"1 Corinthians 14:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>but. 4,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-18","title":"1 Corinthians 14:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>1:4-6; 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-19","title":"1 Corinthians 14:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>in the. 4,21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-20","title":"1 Corinthians 14:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>not. 3:1,2; 13:11; Ps 119:99; Isa 11:3; Ro 16:19; Eph 4:14,15; Php 1:9 Heb 5:12,13; 6:1-3; 2Pe 3:18 malice. Ps 131:1,2; Mt 11:25; 18:3; 19:4; Mr 10:15; 1Pe 2:2 but. Ps 119:99 men. Gr. perfect, or, of a ripe age. 2:6; Php 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-21","title":"1 Corinthians 14:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the law.The passage quoted is taken from the prophet Isaiah; but the term torah, Law, was used by the Jews to express the whole Scriptures, law, prophets, and hagiographia; and they used it to distinguish these Sacred Writings from the words of the scribes. It is not taken from the LXX., from which it varies as much as any words can differ from others where the general meaning is similar. It accords much more with the Hebrew; and may be considered as a translation from it; \"only what is said of God in the third person, in the Hebrew, is here expressed in the first person, with the addition of [lego kurios ,\"] saith the Lord.--Dr. Randolph.</p>\n<p>Joh 10:34; Ro 3:19 With. De 28:49; Isa 28:11,12; Jer 5:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-22","title":"1 Corinthians 14:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>for a. Mr 16:17; Ac 2:6-12,32-36 not to. 1Ti 1:9 but for. 3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-23","title":"1 Corinthians 14:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the whole. 11:18 will. Ho 9:7; Joh 10:20; Ac 2:13; 26:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-24","title":"1 Corinthians 14:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>he is convinced. 2:15; Joh 1:47-49; 4:29; Ac 2:37; Heb 4:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-25","title":"1 Corinthians 14:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>falling. Ge 44:14; De 9:18; Ps 72:11; Isa 60:14; Lu 5:8; 8:28; Re 5:8; 19:4 God is. Isa 45:14; Zec 8:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-26","title":"1 Corinthians 14:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>every. 6; 12:8-10 Let. 4,5,12,40; 12:7; Ro 14:19; 2Co 12:19; 13:10; Eph 4:12,16,29 1Th 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-29","title":"1 Corinthians 14:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the prophets. 39; 12:10; 1Th 5:19-21; 1Jo 4:1-3 the other.Rather, the others, [loi alloi.]</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-30","title":"1 Corinthians 14:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>revealed. 6,26 let. Job 32:11,15-20; 33:31-33; 1Th 5:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-31","title":"1 Corinthians 14:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>all may learn. 3,19,35; Pr 1:5; 9:9; Eph 4:11,12 all may be. Ro 1:12; 2Co 1:4; 7:6,7; Eph 6:22; 1Th 4:18; 5:11,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-32","title":"1 Corinthians 14:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>29,30; 1Sa 10:10-13; 19:19-24; 2Ki 2:3,5; Job 32:8-11; Jer 20:9 Ac 4:19,20; 1Jo 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-33","title":"1 Corinthians 14:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>confusion. Gr. tumult, or unquietness. but. 7:15; Lu 2:14; Ro 15:33; Ga 5:22; 2Th 3:16; Heb 13:20; Jas 3:17,18 in. 4:17; 7:17; 11:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-34","title":"1 Corinthians 14:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>women. 11:5; 1Ti 2:11,12 they are. 35; 11:3,7-10; Eph 5:22-24,33; Col 3:18; Tit 2:5; 1Pe 3:1-6 as. 21; Ge 3:16; Nu 30:3-13; Es 1:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-35","title":"1 Corinthians 14:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>let. Eph 5:25-27; 1Pe 3:7 a shame. 34; 11:6,14; Eph 5:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-36","title":"1 Corinthians 14:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>came. Isa 2:3; Mic 4:1,2; Zec 14:8; Ac 13:1-3; 15:35,36; 16:9,10 Ac 17:1,10,11,15; 18:1-17; 2Co 10:13-16; 1Th 1:8 or. 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-37","title":"1 Corinthians 14:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>any. 8:2; 13:1-3; Nu 24:3,4,16; Ro 12:3; 2Co 10:7,12; 11:4,12-15; Ga 6:8 let. 7:25,40; Lu 10:16; 1Th 4:1-8; 2Pe 3:2; 1Jo 4:6; Jude 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-38","title":"1 Corinthians 14:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Ho 4:17; Mt 7:6; 15:14; 1Ti 6:3-5; 2Ti 4:3,4; Re 22:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-39","title":"1 Corinthians 14:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>covet. 1,3,5,24,25; 12:31; 1Th 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-14-40","title":"1 Corinthians 14:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>26-33; 11:34; Ro 13:13; *marg: Col 2:5; Tit 1:5</p>"}]}